    {"id":"upload-not-active","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-01","context_id":"overview-document-ingestion","question":"文档上传成功为什么还不能检索？","aliases":["HTTP 201等于索引可用吗"],"keywords":["文档上传成功","检索","HTTP 201","索引可用"],"diagnostic":"检查解析、索引和active状态。","hints":["查看 #overview-document-ingestion。","轮询ingestion job。"],"example":"uploaded之后仍需indexed和activate。","answer":"上传只创建版本与作业；解析、索引和原子激活成功后查询才能读取。","source":{"label":"文档接入闭环","href":"#overview-document-ingestion"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"four-entities","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-01","context_id":"concept-source-version-job","question":"来源、版本、块和作业怎样分工？","aliases":["知识库文档为什么要拆四种实体"],"keywords":["来源","版本","块","作业","四种实体"],"diagnostic":"按身份、不可变内容、坐标和处理状态拆分。","hints":["查看 #concept-source-version-job。","沿source树检查关系。"],"example":"source→version→blocks，job处理version。","answer":"来源保存归属和active指针，版本保存不可变内容，块保存坐标文本，作业保存处理状态与错误。","source":{"label":"来源版本块与作业","href":"#concept-source-version-job"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"checksum-idempotency","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-01","context_id":"concept-source-version-job","question":"重复上传怎样避免产生新版本？","aliases":["内容SHA幂等怎么做"],"keywords":["重复上传","新版本","内容SHA","幂等"],"diagnostic":"先按source和checksum查已有版本。","hints":["查看 #concept-source-version-job。","重放返回原version。"],"example":"同内容返回version 1 replay。","answer":"对原始内容计算SHA，在同一source内命中已有checksum就返回原版本和replay。","source":{"label":"来源版本块与作业","href":"#concept-source-version-job"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"markdown-heading","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-01","context_id":"concept-parser-boundaries","question":"Markdown解析要保留什么结构？","aliases":["标题路径为什么要进block"],"keywords":["Markdown解析","标题路径","block"],"diagnostic":"检查正文块是否带当前heading path。","hints":["查看 #concept-parser-boundaries。","用跨标题测试验证。"],"example":"Setup→Create venv。","answer":"正文块至少保留标题路径和顺序，后续切片与引用才能恢复章节语境。","source":{"label":"解析器边界","href":"#concept-parser-boundaries"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"html-parser","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-01","context_id":"concept-parser-boundaries","question":"为什么HTML文本提取不用正则？","aliases":["正则能完整解析HTML吗"],"keywords":["HTML文本提取","正则","解析HTML"],"diagnostic":"检查是否使用结构化HTML parser。","hints":["查看 #concept-parser-boundaries。","区分DOM结构和字符串匹配。"],"example":"html.parser处理标签边界。","answer":"HTML是嵌套结构且含实体和脚本边界，正则容易错；应使用解析器并明确可见文本规则。","source":{"label":"解析器边界","href":"#concept-parser-boundaries"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"pdf-pages","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-01","context_id":"concept-parser-boundaries","question":"数字文本PDF怎样保留引用位置？","aliases":["PDF block为什么要存页码"],"keywords":["数字文本PDF","引用位置","页码"],"diagnostic":"检查逐页提取和1-based页码。","hints":["查看 #concept-parser-boundaries。","引用需回到具体页。"],"example":"page=1。","answer":"逐页提取文本并把1-based页码写入block，后续chunk和citation继承该位置。","source":{"label":"解析器边界","href":"#concept-parser-boundaries"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
