    {"id":"failed-version","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-01","context_id":"example-version-activation","question":"新版本解析失败会影响线上版本吗？","aliases":["v2失败为什么v1还能检索"],"keywords":["新版本解析失败","线上版本","v2失败","v1"],"diagnostic":"检查active是否只在成功后切换。","hints":["查看 #example-version-activation。","验证v2不能activate。"],"example":"active仍为1。","answer":"不会；失败版本保留错误，active指针继续指向已验证v1。","source":{"label":"版本激活","href":"#example-version-activation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"rollback-version","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-01","context_id":"example-version-activation","question":"文档版本怎样回滚？","aliases":["回滚要重新解析旧文件吗"],"keywords":["文档版本","回滚","重新解析"],"diagnostic":"确认目标版本已有成功索引。","hints":["查看 #example-version-activation。","原子切换active指针。"],"example":"active 2→1。","answer":"选择已验证的旧索引版本并原子切换active指针，不重新猜测或解析旧文件。","source":{"label":"版本激活","href":"#example-version-activation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
